Open Tech Art — licensing overview
==================================

1. Website source code (everything outside src/content/, unless noted)
   is licensed under the MIT License (below).

2. Catalog metadata and descriptions written for Open Tech Art
   (the frontmatter and Markdown in src/content/, and the generated
   /resources.json) are dedicated to the public domain under
   CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

3. Third-party resources and screenshots are NOT covered by (1) or (2).
   Every image in src/content/resources/<slug>/ belongs to the creator of
   that resource and is used under the license recorded in that entry's
   frontmatter (`license`). The resources themselves are not redistributed
   here; they are linked at their original location.

